      }
    ]
  },
  "stall_rule": "at an action-bearing place, if the failure-composed out-distribution has zero mass (denominator 0) OR the only surviving out-edge is a synthetic-forward one (the M6-bridged recon islands), the driver re-fires in place (bounded retry, cap K) rather than moving the token — legitimate because the policy layer is not bound by build.py's self-loop dropping; on exhausting K, forced progression along the least-suppressed forward edge guarantees termination under the horizon (R4)",
